# Changelog

## Version 3.0.0 – 2026-10-31 (Part 3: SEO, publishing preparation and JavaScript)
### Added
- `robots.txt` and `sitemap.xml` (7 public pages; placeholder domain to replace after publishing).
- `js/script.js`: mobile menu toggle, back-to-top button, automatic footer year,
  package filter and search, enquiry-form pre-fill/date rules/live summary/validation,
  tour countdowns, and an "open now" office-hours indicator.
- `images/` folder with descriptively named, compressed AVIF/WebP photos and an SVG favicon.
- Unique `<title>` and meta description on every page; Open Graph tags; `lang="en-ZA"`.
- JSON-LD `TravelAgency` structured data on the Home and Contact pages.
- Skip link, visible focus styles, accessible form error messages, reduced-motion support.
- Services page added to the navigation.

### Changed
- Moved the Part 2 stylesheet to `css/style.css` and linked it on every page (it was not linked before).
- One `<h1>` per page with a logical h2/h3 hierarchy.
- Rewrote alt text to describe each image accurately; rewrote vague link text.
- Lazy-loaded below-the-fold images; added width/height to every image; hero images load with high priority.
- Replaced the leftover "Divine Dining" restaurant Events page with a Group Tours page.
- Consistent header and footer (business name, phone, email, hours) on every page.
- Removed CSS rules that broke layouts (`section:has(article)` grid, bold first list item).

### Fixed
- Broken footer links to `index.html` on the Contact and Enquiry pages.
- Wrong stylesheet path on the Services page.
- Cape Town package showing an unrelated hairdresser photo.
- WhatsApp links now open safely with `rel="noopener noreferrer"`.

## Version 2.0.0 – 2026-09-18 (Part 2: CSS)
- Created the master stylesheet with CSS custom properties, reset, grid/flexbox layouts,
  pseudo-classes and responsive breakpoints (1024px, 768px, 480px).

## Version 1.0.0 – 2026-08-11 (Part 1: HTML)
- Created the HTML5 pages with semantic elements, consistent navigation and an enquiry form.
- Added README documentation and this changelog.
